/target
*.ipk
.superpowers/

# `cargo mutants` writes its log, diffs and survivor lists here, and rotates the previous run to
# `mutants.out.old`. CI uploads the directory as an artifact; a local run must not leave it in a
# commit.
/mutants.out*

# A player identity generated in the repository root must never be committed. `identity.json` is
# the name older checkouts used.
/identity.key
/identity.json

# Code factory: run artifacts, per-machine Claude Code settings and personal Claude Code notes.
/.factory/
/.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# A coding agent's project tooling keeps per-machine configuration here.
/.serena/

# `cargo test` (via an external tool or runner) leaves `trait_test*` files in the repository root
# when invoked from there. Root-anchored to avoid masking any intentional files in subdirectories.
/trait_test*

# proptest writes a sibling regression file when a property test fails. Ignored everywhere so that
# a transient failure does not produce an untracked file in the working tree.
**/*.proptest-regressions
